acter・Expression:\nFace tilted towards the left side of the frame. Tea-brown eyes, a small nose, a short chin, holding a lollipop by slightly parted pink lips. Chest-length ash-brown long hair and thin bangs, almost straight, with slightly curved hair ends. Bright cream-colored skin with a hint of peach. The face is in cool and soft shadows, with only the hair edges illuminated by light.\n\nClothing・Posture:\nLight blue and white checkered lace short top with a light blue ribbon on the chest. White lace necklace with a pink round ornament. White sheer stockings wrapped with thin ribbons and side knots, black double-strap platform shoes. Left elbow bent, bringing the lollipop to the mouth. The other hand is hidden inside the low shopping cart. Knees are greatly bent, with legs stretched forward.\n\nBackground・Lighting:\nThe metal mesh of the shopping cart obstructs the right side of the body and waist, with pillars and wheels visible at the bottom right. In the distance are a white SUV and other cars, buildings, and a blue exit sign. A wide area of bright cloudy sky is preserved above. Strong white light from the rear left outlines the hair silhouette, while the skin in front is in soft shadow.\n\nComposition・Lens:\nVertical composition 3:4. Low-angle shot from a position near the ground at the front of the shopping cart, strong Dutch angle. The right platform shoe extends hugely toward the front, and the left shoe is cropped at the bottom edge. The face is located in the middle-left section, heavily overlaid with the shopping cart mesh, leaving sky blank space at the top.\n\nTexture・Style:\nCalm skin tone in shadows with white backlighting photography. Clearly presenting the fine metal mesh, sheer socks, and black platform shoes, maintaining extreme perspective and frame tilt."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 35, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localize