ht platform shoe extends hugely toward the front, and the left shoe is cropped at the bottom edge. The face is located in the middle-left section, heavily overlaid with the shopping cart mesh, leaving sky blank space at the top.\n\nTexture・Style:\nCalm skin tone in shadows with white backlighting photography. Clearly presenting the fine metal mesh, sheer socks, and black platform shoes, maintaining extreme perspective and frame tilt."}}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "gradientNodeSettings": {"11": {"titleTextAlign": "left", "gradientColors": ["#9518f8", "#cbb19a", "to right"], "bgGradientColors": ["#9518f8", "#cbb19a"], "enableTitleGradient": false, "titleGradientDirection": "to bottom", "borderRadius": 0, "fontSize": 14, "titleGradientColors": [], "bgGradientDirection": "to right", "fontColor": "#ffffff", "titleTextY": 0}, "1": {"titleTextAlign": "left", "gradientColors": ["#cf4453", "#3f751c", "to right"], "bgGradientColors": ["#cf4453", "#3f751c"], "enableTitleGradient": false, "titleGradientDirection": "to bottom", "borderRadius": 0, "fontSize": 14, "titleGradientColors": [], "bgGradientDirection": "to right", "fontColor": "#ffffff", "titleTextY": 0}, "2": {"titleTextAlign": "left", "gradientColors": ["#cf4453", "#3f751c", "to right"], "bgGradientColors": ["#cf4453", "#3f751c"], "enableTitleGradient": false, "titleGradientDirection": "to bottom", "borderRadius": 0, "fontSize": 14, "titleGradientColors": [], "bgGradientDirection": "to right", "fontColor": "#ffffff", "titleTextY": 0}, "13": {"titleTextAlign": "left", "gradientColors": ["#cf4453", "#3f751c", "to right"], "bgGradientColors": ["#cf4453", "#3f751c"], "enableTitleGradient": false, "titleGradientDirection": "to bottom", "borderRadius": 0, "fontSize": 14, "titleGradientColors": [], "bgGradientDirection": "to right", "fontColor": "#ffffff", "titleTextY": 0}, "3": {"titleTextAlign": "left", "gradientColors": ["#cf4453", "#3f751c", "to right"], "bgGradientColors": ["#cf44